矣。蓋聞天與弗取，反受其咎；時至不行，反受其殃。願足下孰慮之。』","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"武涉","kind":"person","person_id":"49t_1cr_hfa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"蒯通","kind":"person","person_id":"x9q_ghs_z2s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"v8v_2nz_wdy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"v8v_2nz_wdy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"v8v_2nz_wdy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0093","start":93,"end":95,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"v8v_2nz_wdy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0118","start":118,"end":119,"surface":"信","kind":"person","person_id":"v8v_2nz_wdy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0122","start":122,"end":124,"surface":"左右","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者或未定指代保留原文，不補姓名成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0128","start":128,"end":129,"surface":"通","kind":"person","person_id":"x9q_ghs_z2s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0159","start":159,"end":161,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"v8v_2nz_wdy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0169","start":169,"end":171,"surface":"蒯通","kind":"person","person_id":"x9q_ghs_z2s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0304","start":304,"end":306,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cz8_no4_4jl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0419","start":419,"end":421,"surf